  "title": "Ozma of Oz - Colophon (Fragment 1)",
  "text": "Ozma of Oz was published in 1907 by L. Frank Baum.\n\nThis ebook was produced for Standard Ebooks by Elizabeth Miller-Boldt, and is based on a transcription produced in 2010 by Chris Curnow, Joseph Cooper, and Distributed Proofreaders for Project Gutenberg and on digital scans from the Internet Archive.\n\nThe cover page is adapted from Desert Motif from the Journey to Egypt, a painting completed in 1903 by Jan Ciągliński. The cover and title pages feature the League Spartan and Sorts Mill Goudy typefaces created in 2014 and 2009 by The League of Moveable Type.\n\nThis edition was released on August 15, 2026, 5:39 p.m. and is based on revision 4a74e32. The first edition of this ebook was released on May 31, 2024, 4:22 a.m. You can check for updates to this ebook, view its revision history, or download it for different ereading systems at standardebooks.org/ebooks/l-frank-baum/ozma-of-oz.\n\nThe volunteer-driven Standard Ebooks project relies on readers like you to submit typos, corrections, and other improvements. Anyone can contribute at standardebooks.org.",
